          one_liner: 'One width of cloth, one price, sworn before the looms.',
          subject: 'a weavers\' charter',
          detail:
            'The guild scratched its rule into a doorpost: the bolt stays honest, the dyer gets his share, and no one undercuts a widow\'s price. It has outlasted three guildmasters and one flood.',
